The distributed plugin is not only this repository's source. `main.js` and
`styles.css` embed a complete TeX engine, a set of TeX packages and a set of
fonts, all of which carry their own terms. The list below is what is actually
inside the files you install, with the licence each part is redistributed under.
Full texts are in vendor/LICENSES/.

The plugin as a whole is GPL-3.0-or-later because the engine it embeds is.


ENGINE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

drgrice1/tikzjax                                              GPL-3.0-or-later
  https://github.com/drgrice1/tikzjax
  Copyright Jim Fowler, Glenn Rice.
  engine-src/library.ts and engine-src/worker.ts are modified forks of
  src/library.js and src/run-tex.js. Changes are listed in the header of each
  file and in docs/DECISIONS.md D10.
  Itself derived from kisonecat/tikzjax (https://github.com/kisonecat/tikzjax).

drgrice1/web2js                                               GPL-3.0
  https://github.com/drgrice1/web2js
  Compiles the Pascal source of TeX to WebAssembly. Produces the tex.wasm and
  core.dump embedded in main.js. Not modified.
  Itself derived from kisonecat/web2js and jhoobergs/web2js.

@drgrice1/dvi2html                                            GPL-3.0
  https://github.com/drgrice1/dvi2html
  Converts TeX's DVI output to SVG. Bundled unmodified from npm.

